<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<class xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" name="FmodGeometryInstance3D" inherits="StaticBody3D" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd">
	<brief_description>
		Static 3D audio occlusion geometry for FMOD.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		FmodGeometryInstance3D creates an FMOD Geometry object from child [CollisionShape3D] nodes, a selected [MeshInstance3D], or a [Mesh] resource. It is designed to be placed in the scene as a solid audio occluder: add this node, add collision shapes below it, then tune direct and reverb occlusion in the Inspector.
		The node keeps the FMOD geometry transform synchronized with its global transform at runtime.
	</description>
